# Tool versions used by this project. Pin exactly what CI uses
# (.github/workflows/ci.yml) so a fresh clone via asdf or mise sets
# up an identical local environment in one command.
#
# Why PostgreSQL is pinned to 17: backend/db/structure.sql contains
# the SET transaction_timeout = 0 directive (added by Rails 8 / PG17
# on db:schema:dump). PG 16.x and earlier psql binaries fail with
# `unrecognized configuration parameter "transaction_timeout"` when
# loading the schema — a real friction surface for new contributors.
ruby 3.4.7
nodejs 22.13.0
postgres 17
